        <attribute name="narrative details - external">A young white male asks Loretta if he can use the card she is selling to fly to the Caribbean.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Loretta, Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="130" start="389.04001" end="395.56">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Loretta flirts and uses her harmless, endearing, homely stereotype to her advantage in making sales.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Loretta, the old black lady, successfully signs up another white customer. She acts friendly and flirtatious with him.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Loretta, Boy</attribute>
