      <el index="132" start="397.79999" end="402.12">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Loretta is not the jolly stereotype she puts on for sales.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">While the young white traveler signs up for a card, Loretta, the old black lady, sees Earn and Swiff watching. Her smile fades and she glares at them.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Loretta, Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="133" start="402.12" end="408.04001">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Loretta taunts Earn and Swiff and is not truly the kind, flirty, stereotypical old, black woman she puts on.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Loretta starts pretending to hump the young boy from behind while he signs up.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Loretta, Boy</attribute>
      </el>
