      <el index="178" start="510.20001" end="511.92001">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn's father is surprised and skeptical. His mother is more interested in Van's date. Earn's parents are not proud of him.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn's father asks if Earn really got a Job. His mother congratulates Van on her date.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Dad, Mom</attribute>
