        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="415" start="1256.64001" end="1258.80005">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn has decided he can/is willing to smoke and be high while doing business</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn looks at Alfred Paper Boy and the blunt (marijuana cigar), thinks for a second, and smiles</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="416" start="1258.80005" end="1262.40002">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn opens the door and gets into the car.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="417" start="1262.40002" end="1268.28003">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Alfred Paper Boy is happy Earn will smoke while doing business and is beginning to respect and like him more. The two are beginning to get along.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn takes the blunt (marijuana cigar) from Alfred Paper Boy, takes a hit, and widens his eyes jokingly. Alfred Paper laughs and punches him lightly.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="418" start="1268.28003" end="1270.23999">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn exhales and nods his head</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="419" start="1270.23999" end="1271.88">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn exhales and fist-bumps Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="420" start="1271.88" end="1275.35999">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Alfred Paper Boy is happy his song is on the radio and pleased with Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn sits in the car and continues smoking the blunt (marijuana cigar) in the car. Alfred Paper Boy dances in the driver's seat.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="421" start="1275.35999" end="1277.04004">
