        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="422" start="1277.04004" end="1279.71997">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave walks up to the car and leans on the open door. Earn greets him.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="423" start="1279.71997" end="1280.43994">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave greets Earn, Alfred Paper Boy, and Darius.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="424" start="1280.43994" end="1281.56006">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn nods. Alfred Paper Boy and Darius, who is sitting in the back seat of the car, greet Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="425" start="1281.56006" end="1284.52002">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Dave is disappointed Earn did not give him the money</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave asks Earn how he got into the radio station earlier</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="426" start="1284.52002" end="1288">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn is using Dave's words from earlier ("it's all about who you know") against him, to answer his question without telling him how.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn shrugs and coolly tells Dave that he knew somebody who let him in.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="427" start="1288" end="1290.64001">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Dave is upset he did not get the bribe money, and got in trouble for the bribe being offered</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave tells Earn that what he did was unprofessional and his boss, KP, is mad</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="428" start="1290.64001" end="1293.40002">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn retorts that Dave's boss cannot be too pissed because the song is playing on the radio now.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="429" start="1293.40002" end="1297.23999">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave looks into the car at Alfred Paper Boy and Darius. Earn introduces Dave and says he works at the radio station.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="430" start="1297.23999" end="1299.56006">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn looks around at Alfred Paper Boy and Darius and tells them Dave likes Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="431" start="1299.56006" end="1302.56006">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn is messing with Dave, trying to get him to use racist language around Alfred Paper Boy and Darius, or see if he will not</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn remembers the Flo Rida story Dave told him in the parking lot and tells him to recount it for Alfred Paper Boy and Darius</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="432" start="1302.56006" end="1304.07996">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn wants to see whether or not Dave will use the n-word ("nigga") around other black people</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave leans on the door of the car and smiles. Earn tries to convince him to retell the story about Flo Rida.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="433" start="1304.07996" end="1306.56006">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave listens to Earn, laughs, and decides to tell the story.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="434" start="1306.56006" end="1310.52002">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave starts retelling the story to Alfred Paper Boy and Darius.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="435" start="1310.52002" end="1314.04004">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn feigns interest in Dave's story, egging him on to tell it the way he did earlier.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn grins, then begins nodding seriously at Dave's story.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="436" start="1314.04004" end="1322.28003">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Dave thinks it is a great story, and very funny</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave recounts the story of the bad DJ ruining the station party by playing Flo Rida back-to-back</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="437" start="1322.28003" end="1326.64001">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn, Darius, and Alfred Paper Boy are clearly disinterested in the story.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave continues telling the story. Earn, Darius, and Alfred Paper Boy look at him silently from inside the car.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="438" start="1326.64001" end="1331.80005">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Dave knows he should not use racist terms, particularly around African Americans, but somehow does not see Earn as "black" the same way he does Alfred Paper Boy or Darius, and so is comfortable doing so around him.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave keeps telling the story, gets to the punchline, and conspicuously does not say "nigga" this time.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="439" start="1331.80005" end="1335.07996">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">There is a long, awkward silence. Darius and Alfred Paper Boy are not amused by the story. Earn is no longer pretending to be interested.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn, Darius, and Alfred Paper Boy silently stare, straight-faced, at Dave.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="440" start="1335.07996" end="1337.47998">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">The three men in the car are unimpressed by the story and did not think it was funny.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Darius speaks up from the back seat and says he likes Flo Rida.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="441" start="1337.47998" end="1339.95996">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Darius says that Flo Rida has merit as rap because it is accessible to Moms.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Darius, Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="442" start="1339.95996" end="1344.59998">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Dave feels awkward and backtracks. He wants to impress the others and agrees with whatever they say.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave pauses, then calls the story awkward and wonders why Earn made him tell it.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="443" start="1344.59998" end="1346.40002">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn grins facetiously, trying to convey to Dave that he noticed the difference and wants Dave to be conscious that he told it differently.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn grins and says he does not know</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="444" start="1346.40002" end="1348.07996">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Dave feels awkward, and realizes why Earn called him out and that he is not admired there.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave looks down and nods silently.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="445" start="1348.07996" end="1350.31995">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave tells Earn it was good to see him</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="446" start="1350.31995" end="1352.68005">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Dave puts up two fingers in a peace sign and tells Alfred Paper Boy and Darius it was nice to meet them.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="447" start="1352.68005" end="1355.40002">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred Paper Boy says bye to Dave. Dave stands up and walks away.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn, Dave</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="448" start="1355.40002" end="1357.28003">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn watches Dave walk away and closes the passenger side car door. Alfred Paper Boy picks up the blunt (marijuana cigar).</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="449" start="1357.28003" end="1358.95996">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn mockingly mentions KP because he knows he got Dave in the trouble he deserved</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn calls after Dave and tells him to say hello to his boss, KP.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="450" start="1358.95996" end="1362.16003">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn leans back in the car seat, looks at Alfred Paper Boy, and relaxes. Alfred Paper Boy starts moving / dancing to his song on the radio.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="451" start="1362.16003" end="1365.80005">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Alfred Paper Boy's confidence from his song being on the radio is going to his head</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred Paper Boy leans out the window of the car and tries to get the attention of a woman walking by</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="452" start="1365.80005" end="1367.35999">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred tells the girl that the song playing on the radio is his.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn, Woman</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="453" start="1367.35999" end="1368.76001">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">The woman responds rudely.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">The woman brushes Alfred Paper Boy off.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn, Woman</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="454" start="1368.76001" end="1372.12">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Alfred Paper Boy is offended and hurt that the woman is not impressed by him.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred Paper Boy yells after the woman and insults her.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="455" start="1372.12" end="1376.04004">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Alfred Paper Boy feels dejected and humiliated.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred Paper Boy sits back in the car seat and sighs.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="456" start="1376.04004" end="1379.47998">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn's eyes are thin and droopy because he is high.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn looks at Alfred Paper Boy, smiles, and nods his head.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="457" start="1379.47998" end="1381.35999">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn is trying to boost Alfred Paper Boy's confidence.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn tells Alfred Paper Boy his song is good.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="458" start="1381.35999" end="1385.92004">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Alfred Paper Boy is moping after being rejected. His swagger and confidence is gone.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred rolls his eyes, says he hates the song, and turns off the radio.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="459" start="1385.92004" end="1386.35999">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">There is some déja vu happening. The beginning of the episode was a flash-forward and picks up here.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Just like in the beginning, a foot from outside the car kicks off Alfred Paper Boy's side mirror.</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="460" start="1386.35999" end="1389.23999">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">The man kicked off the mirror because Alfred Paper Boy insulted the woman.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred Paper Boy jumps, looks out the window, and shouts. A man and the woman he yelled at walk by the car.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn, Man, Woman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="461" start="1389.23999" end="1391.59998">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred Paper Boy calls after the man and opens his door. He then reaches into the glove compartment for a gun.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="462" start="1391.59998" end="1393.83997">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred Paper Boy reaches into the glovebox to pull out a gun. Earn stops him and looks at him.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="463" start="1393.83997" end="1396.16003">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn thinks that getting in a fight or legal trouble would be bad for Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn looks Alfred Paper Boy in the eye and tells him not to mess with the money.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="464" start="1396.16003" end="1398.80005">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Alfred Paper Boy is in a bad mood and ignores Earn's advice</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred Paper Boy looks at Earn and gets out of the car</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="465" start="1398.80005" end="1401.56006">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn sees trouble coming and is frustrated.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn calls after Alfred paper Boy and curses. Outside the car, Alfred Paper Boy yells at the man.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="466" start="1401.56006" end="1405.31995">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn reaches into the glovebox and pulls out the gun. Alfred speaks to the man.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="467" start="1405.31995" end="1408.52002">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Alfred Paper Boy and Darius follow the man and woman. Alfred Paper Boy leans down to pick up the mirror from the ground and calls after the man and woman. Earn gets out of the car and runs after them.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Man, Woman, Alfred Paper Boy, Darius, Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="468" start="1408.52002" end="1411.23999">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">BLACK SCREEN 4</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="469" start="1411.23999" end="1415.28003">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Earn's mother picks up her purse and walks toward the door. The news plays on a television on the background</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Mom, Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="470" start="1415.28003" end="1420.16003">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Earn's mother seems drunk</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Van, wearing a nice dress, opens the door and walks in. Earn's mother walks out the door past her and quickly says that she took care of Lottie because Earn had business, and that she drank her wine. The news plays on TV in the background.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Mom, Van, Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="471" start="1420.16003" end="1421.23999">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Van is surprised Earn's mother drank her entire bottle of wine.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Van calls after Earn's mother as she walks out the door.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Van, Mom, Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="472" start="1421.23999" end="1425.56006">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Van thanks Earn's mother and closes the door behind her.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Van, Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="473" start="1425.56006" end="1428.56006">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Van takes her shoes off. The woman on TV reports on the news.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Van, Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="474" start="1428.56006" end="1436.04004">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Van pulls her shoes off and walks into her apartment. The reporter on TV continues.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Van, Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="475" start="1436.04004" end="1438.40002">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Van walks past the TV. The woman on TV reports on the news.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Van, Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="476" start="1438.40002" end="1443.12">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">The news report switches to covering a shooting</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="477" start="1443.12" end="1448.04004">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">The woman on the TV names Alfred Paper Boy and Earn as suspects in the shooting.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="478" start="1448.04004" end="1451.56006">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">The woman on the TV says that a third suspect was wounded, but not killed.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="479" start="1451.56006" end="1457.56006">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">The news shows pictures of Alfred Paper Boy's and Earn's faces. Van walks up to the television to watch.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Reporter, Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="480" start="1457.56006" end="1461.43994">
        <attribute name="narrative details - internal">Van is surprised and furious with Earn for being irresponsible, and getting into trouble instead of taking care of Lottie, like she asked.</attribute>
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Van stares, mouth open, at the television. The reporter says where and why the shooting happened.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="481" start="1461.43994" end="1462.52002">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">Van stares at the TV screen. She calls Earn an idiot out loud.</attribute>
        <attribute name="characters on screen">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="482" start="1462.52002" end="1466.04004">
        <attribute name="narrative details - external">BLACK SCREEN 5</attribute>
        <attribute name="Music Presence">true</attribute>
      </el>
    </track>
    <track name="speech" type="span" ref="Scene info">
      <el index="0" start="0" end="0">
        <attribute name="transcription">"What the?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="1" start="1" end="1">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Really man?! Hey man! Hey!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="2" start="2" end="2">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Alfred!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="3" start="3" end="3">
        <attribute name="transcription">""Hey man, I'm gonna need some cash for this mirror, man!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="4" start="4" end="4">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Alfred!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="5" start="5" end="5">
        <attribute name="transcription">Hey!</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="6" start="6" end="6">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hello? Hello?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="7" start="7" end="7">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, hey" "Man I know you hear me"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="8" start="8" end="8">
        <attribute name="transcription">"talking to you man, I'm speaking English!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="9" start="9" end="9">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey alright, cool it. Let's, let's, let's just keep it cool, okay guys?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="10" start="10" end="10">
        <attribute name="transcription">""Nigga if you don't get out of my face..."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="11" start="11" end="11">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Worldstar!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Background</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="12" start="12" end="12">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No don't do that to us."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="13" start="13" end="13">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No, no, no, no, no, I think I'm being more than fair, calmly asking for compensation, so let's go bruh."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="14" start="14" end="14">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No, y'all staying broke tonight."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="15" start="15" end="15">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Look, you're trying to get into the club"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="16" start="16" end="16">
        <attribute name="transcription">"before ten forty-five, which means you're trying to get in before eleven, which means you are also broke. Nobody's stunting on anybody here."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="17" start="17" end="17">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No one's stunting on anyone here."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Woman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="18" start="18" end="18">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Bitch, will you please shut the hell up?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="19" start="19" end="19">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Don't you talk to me like that!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Woman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="20" start="20" end="20">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No I talk to whoever however I want, if you got a problem with it, we can settle it, but my car was not involved, man." "Hold on, cuz!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy, Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="21" start="21" end="21">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hold on, hold on, man"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="22" start="22" end="22">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'm getting crazy déja vu right now. Okay where's the dog with the Texas on him?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="23" start="23" end="23">
        <attribute name="transcription">"There he is!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="24" start="24" end="24">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That's a trip, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="25" start="25" end="25" />
      <el index="26" start="26" end="26">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yo, what's your man on?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="27" start="27" end="27">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yo, worry about this mirror, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="28" start="28" end="28">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Just get another mirror. You Paper Boy."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Woman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="29" start="29" end="29">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You rich, right?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Woman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="30" start="30" end="30">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Woah! Woah, woah, woah, woah"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="31" start="31" end="31">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Woah, woah, woah. You Paper Boy?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="32" start="32" end="32">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You know it."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="33" start="33" end="33">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Boy, you so garbage, that"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="34" start="34" end="34">
        <attribute name="transcription">"postal mixtape was garbage, what it"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="35" start="35" end="35">
        <attribute name="transcription">"was, uh, uh, uh, Muckin'! What the hell is Muckin', Paper Boy?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="36" start="36" end="35">
        <attribute name="transcription">"postal mixtape was garbage, what it"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="37" start="36" end="36">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Man, you know what it is. I explain in the hook, nigga."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="38" start="37" end="37">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Why we even talking, man, shit, what's going on, what's good?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="39" start="38" end="38">
        <attribute name="transcription">"This is definitely going to Worldstar!" "No it is not, stop it. Nigga, what are you doing?" "Nigga, what are you doing?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Background</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="40" start="39" end="39">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No it is not, stop it. Nigga, what are you doing?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="41" start="40" end="40">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Nigga, what are you doing?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="42" start="41" end="41">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Okay, well what's up? Hmm?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="43" start="42" end="42">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah. I got my"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="44" start="43" end="43">
        <attribute name="transcription">"people waiting right over there. Watch out, baby."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="45" start="44" end="44">
        <attribute name="transcription">"What's up? Let's go, what's up?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="46" start="45" end="45" />
      <el index="47" start="46" end="46" />
      <el index="48" start="47" end="47" />
      <el index="49" start="48" end="48" />
      <el index="50" start="49" end="49">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Wait."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="51" start="50" end="50">
        <attribute name="transcription">"This is so weird, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="52" start="51" end="51" />
      <el index="53" start="53" end="53">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Back at it, craftmatic, all I know is mathematics"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">OJ da Juiceman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="54" start="54" end="54">
        <attribute name="transcription">"On the stove, cooking chicken, right wrist just did"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">OJ da Juiceman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="55" start="55" end="55">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Gymnastics, acrobatic with the work. Like Houdini do the magic, Migo bring me"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">OJ da Juiceman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="56" start="56" end="56">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Kilos so I bust them squares up out the plastic, get in traffic"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">OJ da Juiceman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="57" start="57" end="57">
        <attribute name="transcription">"'bout to traffic, known to make that shit happen"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">OJ da Juiceman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="58" start="58" end="58">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Gotta use the razor 'cause the chicken's in some turkey wrapping"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">OJ da Juiceman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="59" start="59" end="59">
        <attribute name="transcription">"after fifteen years of trapping, now young Juice just started rapping, blowing '93 OG from Freddy that he"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">OJ da Juiceman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="60" start="60" end="60" />
      <el index="61" start="61" end="61" />
      <el index="62" start="62" end="62" />
      <el index="63" start="63" end="63" />
      <el index="64" start="64" end="64">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh my god, why are you up?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="65" start="65" end="65">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I had a weird dream."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="66" start="66" end="66">
        <attribute name="transcription">“I was swimming in this pool but it was like the ocean, and I was swimming with this seaweed, but it wasn't seaweed, it was... it was like hands."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="67" start="67" end="67">
        <attribute name="transcription">“And I was swimming with this girl. And she was saying if the hands grab you, they pull you down and drown you, so to swim above them."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="68" start="68" end="68">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hmm. That's deep." "I know."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van, Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="69" start="69" end="69">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I think it's about society"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="70" start="70" end="70">
        <attribute name="transcription">"cause like all"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="71" start="71" end="71">
        <attribute name="transcription">"the hands are" "Who's the girl?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn, Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="72" start="72" end="72">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I don't know."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="73" start="73" end="73">
        <attribute name="transcription">"What's she look like?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="74" start="74" end="74">
        <attribute name="transcription">"She was fat. And not interesting."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="75" start="75" end="75">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Okay."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="76" start="76" end="76">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You jealous?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="77" start="77" end="77">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'm disappointed in your story, cause you're first saying that she's fat and annoying and then you, all of a sudden you turn around and you're making out with this bitch."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="78" start="78" end="78">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I never said we were making out."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="79" start="79" end="79">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Were you making out?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="80" start="80" end="80">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah. Yeah, we were."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="81" start="81" end="81">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I know you."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="82" start="82" end="82">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="83" start="83" end="83">
        <attribute name="transcription">"you don't know me."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="84" start="84" end="84">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh, no, bad breath."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="85" start="85" end="85">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh, I love it. What is that, curry?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="86" start="86" end="86">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Are you kidding me?" Like a very deep curry?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van, Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="87" start="87" end="87">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That is not, that's like some freaky shit!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="88" start="88" end="88">
        <attribute name="transcription">"What is wrong with you?" "I love that. I love that."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van, Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="89" start="89" end="89">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You're so stupid."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="90" start="90" end="90" />
      <el index="91" start="91" end="91" />
      <el index="92" start="92" end="92">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Tell me you love me"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="93" start="93" end="93" />
      <el index="94" start="94" end="94">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Why did you just laugh?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="95" start="95" end="95">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Cause you always say that and I'm always like of course"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="96" start="96" end="96">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Then why didn't you just say I love you?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="97" start="97" end="97">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I love you"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="98" start="98" end="98" />
      <el index="99" start="99" end="99" />
      <el index="100" start="100" end="100">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Uh oh"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="101" start="101" end="101">
        <attribute name="transcription">"She's awake! She's gonna kill us all with her cuteness!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="102" start="102" end="102">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You remember you have Lottie tonight, right?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="103" start="103" end="103">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey there! Of course I did. I did not."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="104" start="104" end="104">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Cause I have parent teacher conferences."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="105" start="105" end="104" />
      <el index="106" start="105" end="105">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Also, I don't always want her at your parents' house. She lives here."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="107" start="106" end="106">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I promise she won't be at my parents' house. I'll pick her up after work."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="108" start="107" end="107">
        <attribute name="transcription">"And if you're going to be staying here, I'm gonna need your help with rent."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="109" start="108" end="108">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'll, I'll get it to you tonight. What time are you coming back?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="110" start="109" end="109">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I don't know, probably like eleven?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="111" start="110" end="110">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Eleven? Eleven's a little late."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="112" start="111" end="111">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You, uh, taking the parents to Magic City's? Folly's? You know Cheeta's is actually a better spot for that."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="113" start="112" end="112">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I have a date."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="114" start="113" end="113" />
      <el index="115" start="114" end="114">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You're with Daddy tonight! Mommy's going on a date with some corny dude!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="116" start="115" end="115">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, some corny dude! What? No, this is a great environment for you!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="117" start="116" end="115">
        <attribute name="transcription">"What? No, this is a great environment for you!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="118" start="116" end="115">
        <attribute name="transcription">"What? No, this is a great environment for you!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="119" start="116" end="116">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You have a nice flight now."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Loretta</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="120" start="117" end="117">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Excuse me sir"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="121" start="118" end="118">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Fuck off."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Traveler</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="122" start="119" end="119">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I know, right?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="123" start="120" end="120">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That was just rude, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="124" start="121" end="121">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Ayo, Compound was lit last night. Me and my cousin had like eight bottles up in that bitch, left out with like three hoes apiece, my nigga. Shit was crazy."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="125" start="122" end="122">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey we gonna hit two dollar Tuesday at the Alta, you wanna roll?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="126" start="123" end="123">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Earn."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="127" start="124" end="124">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Ayo Earn."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="128" start="125" end="125">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Got him!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="129" start="126" end="126">
        <attribute name="transcription">"How you look when you high at work."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="130" start="127" end="127">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Van's dating other people."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="131" start="128" end="128">
        <attribute name="transcription">"She's gonna kick me out the house. I'm also broke and I can't sign anyone up cause I'm not an old lady."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="132" start="129" end="129">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Can I go to the Caribbean on this?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="133" start="130" end="130">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Well of course you can, honey! I'll even give you an extra flight, as long as you keep flirting with me."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Loretta</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="134" start="131" end="131">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh, okay"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="135" start="132" end="132" />
      <el index="136" start="133" end="133" />
      <el index="137" start="134" end="134">
        <attribute name="transcription">"This bitch is amazing."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="138" start="135" end="135">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That's really rough."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="139" start="136" end="136">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I don't know, I would watch."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="140" start="137" end="137">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That's more rough."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="141" start="138" end="138">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Ayo you heard that new Paper Boy mixtape, man? I heard it's coming out this Friday, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="142" start="139" end="139">
        <attribute name="transcription">"His last one was hot."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="143" start="140" end="140">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I haven't really been keeping up, man, I don't know who that is."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="144" start="141" end="141">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Man, get out your lil cave, lil boy! Hey, check it out, here, go to video, right here."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="145" start="142" end="142">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hit the magic city and I bet that paper make her strip"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="146" start="143" end="143">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Paper man, paper man, catch me in the paper, man, like Wall Street"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="147" start="144" end="144">
        <attribute name="transcription">" Journal yeah cause imma get that paper, man. That paper man" "Woo, ayo that's flour, right?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy, Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="148" start="145" end="145">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That's my cousin."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="149" start="146" end="146">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Damn, she is thick as fuck. Is that weird for you?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="150" start="147" end="147">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No, Paper Boy. Paper Boy's my cousin."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="151" start="148" end="148">
        <attribute name="transcription">"If that's your cousin, man, you're gonna wanna get in there before he gets signed, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="152" start="149" end="149" />
      <el index="153" start="150" end="150">
        <attribute name="transcription">"They offering that boy seven m's on the table."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="154" start="151" end="151">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Is that a real offer?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="155" start="152" end="152">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That's a real offer, them real m's!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="156" start="153" end="153">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Alright, man, I'll catch you later."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="157" start="154" end="154">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Where you going? You going to talk to him? Hey, tell him I said what up."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="158" start="155" end="155">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Is that really your cousin in the video with the big tits?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="159" start="156" end="156">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You don't know Paper Boy!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Swiff</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="160" start="158" end="157" />
      <el index="161" start="158" end="157" />
      <el index="162" start="158" end="157" />
      <el index="163" start="158" end="158" />
      <el index="164" start="159" end="159" />
      <el index="165" start="160" end="160">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Son."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="166" start="161" end="161">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, Dad."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="167" start="162" end="162">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Where's Mom?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="168" start="163" end="163">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, Earn."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Mom</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="169" start="164" end="164">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, Mom."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="170" start="165" end="165">
        <attribute name="transcription">"How are you?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="171" start="166" end="166">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Good. How are you?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="172" start="167" end="167">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'm good!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="173" start="168" end="168">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Good."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="174" start="169" end="169">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You gonna invite me in?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="175" start="170" end="170">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="176" start="171" end="171">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Why not?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="177" start="172" end="172">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I can't afford it."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="178" start="173" end="173">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Come on, you really think I'm here for money?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="179" start="174" end="174" />
      <el index="180" start="175" end="175">
        <attribute name="transcription">"We do, yes."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Mom</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="181" start="176" end="176">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'm looking for Alfred. Also, could you pick up Lottie from Kaya's?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="182" start="177" end="177">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'm getting a job and Van's on a date."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="183" start="178" end="178">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You got a job?" "Really? Good for her!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad, Mom</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="184" start="179" end="179">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yes, I got a job. And thanks, Mom."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="185" start="180" end="180">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'm your son, Earn? I used to live in there with you, remember?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="186" start="181" end="181">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Used to? There was a"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="187" start="182" end="182">
        <attribute name="transcription">"a turd the size of my arm waiting for me when I got home yesterday. You supposed to be so smart"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="188" start="183" end="183">
        <attribute name="transcription">"you can't remember to flush?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="189" start="184" end="184">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That wasn't me."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="190" start="185" end="185">
        <attribute name="transcription">"It was you."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Mom</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="191" start="186" end="186">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I checked. You better eat something real, instead of all them candies and cookies and whatever was in there."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Mom</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="192" start="187" end="187">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Did you break it up with a stick?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="193" start="188" end="188">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Alfred's at the Glenwood Apartments. Love you, son."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="194" start="189" end="189" />
      <el index="195" start="190" end="190" />
      <el index="196" start="191" end="191" />
      <el index="197" start="192" end="192" />
      <el index="198" start="193" end="193" />
      <el index="199" start="194" end="194" />
      <el index="200" start="195" end="195" />
      <el index="201" start="196" end="196">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, is this milk any good?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="202" start="197" end="197">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Whatchu using it for?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="203" start="198" end="198">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Drinking."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="204" start="199" end="199">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah nah, man, don't use it to drink."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="205" start="200" end="200" />
      <el index="206" start="201" end="201" />
      <el index="207" start="202" end="202" />
      <el index="208" start="203" end="203">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Your peep hole's for real."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="209" start="204" end="204" />
      <el index="210" start="205" end="205">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That's Darius"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="211" start="206" end="206">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Cookie?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="212" start="207" end="207">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Thanks"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="213" start="208" end="208">
        <attribute name="transcription">"So, Zoo Tycoon"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="214" start="209" end="209">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You want in on Paper Boy."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="215" start="210" end="210">
        <attribute name="transcription">"What? No!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="216" start="211" end="211">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Please, man"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="217" start="212" end="212">
        <attribute name="transcription">"people ain't just nice, Earn. When's the last time you were nice to a girl you weren't trying to smash?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="218" start="213" end="213">
        <attribute name="transcription">"This morning."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="219" start="214" end="214">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You're talking about your daughter, man, that's gross."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="220" start="215" end="215">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Nah, it'd be gross if I was trying to smash."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="221" start="216" end="216" />
      <el index="222" start="217" end="217">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I don't want a handout, I want to manage you."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="223" start="218" end="218">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You know where the word manage come from?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="224" start="219" end="219">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Manus? Latin word for hand?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="225" start="220" end="220">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Probably, but imma say no for the purpose of my argument. 'Manage' comes from the word 'man,' and, uh, that ain't really your lane."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="226" start="221" end="221">
        <attribute name="transcription">"My lane?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="227" start="222" end="222">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, man, I need Malcolm."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="228" start="223" end="223">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah man, I need Malcolm. You too Martin. You know what they did to Martin? They killed him."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="229" start="224" end="224">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Didn't they kill Malcolm too?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="230" start="225" end="225">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh no, no, they say that. But ain't nobody seen the body since the funeral."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="231" start="226" end="226">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That's how funerals work. Alfred, you already Malcolm. You have that already. What you really need is a silent"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="232" start="227" end="227">
        <attribute name="transcription">"wild card, somebody who is about the money, the opportunity,"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="233" start="228" end="228">
        <attribute name="transcription">"who can play both sides if needed."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="234" start="229" end="229">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh, like Don Lemon."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="235" start="230" end="230">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Fair point, let me rephrase what I'm trying to say."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn, Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="236" start="231" end="231">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh wait, wait wait. It's four thirty."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="237" start="232" end="232">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh damn, man, we late."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="238" start="233" end="233" />
      <el index="239" start="234" end="234" />
      <el index="240" start="235" end="235">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="241" start="236" end="236">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Since when?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="242" start="237" end="237">
        <attribute name="transcription">"We're doing business"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="243" start="238" end="238">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Wait, you want to manage a rapper but you can't do business high?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="244" start="239" end="239">
        <attribute name="transcription">"VH1 is hiring interns. And that sounds like a joke, but they actually, they tweeted that this morning."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="245" start="240" end="240" />
      <el index="246" start="241" end="241">
        <attribute name="transcription">"How's Princeton, by the way?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="247" start="242" end="242">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Still in that year off? Three years is a long year off."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="248" start="243" end="243">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I guess."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="249" start="244" end="244">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I think I know what happened."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="250" start="245" end="245">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I really think you don't"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="251" start="246" end="246" />
      <el index="252" start="247" end="247">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Look, man, is there somewhere we can talk for real? Cause, I'm sorry, who is this dude?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="253" start="248" end="248">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'm Darius, man! We met over there by the, when you first walked in." "No I'm fine with talking right here."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="254" start="249" end="249">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I gave you a cookie"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="255" start="250" end="250">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No, yeah, I remember who you are. Look, I'm not asking for money."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="256" start="251" end="251">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You should be, ain't you homeless?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="257" start="252" end="252">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Not real homeless. I'm not using a rat as a phone or something."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="258" start="253" end="253">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Don't be racist, man. That makes you schizophrenic, that don't make you homeless."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="259" start="254" end="254">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Wait, wait, not if it worked, man. Nah, if you could use a rat as a phone, that'd be genius."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="260" start="255" end="255">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I mean it's like five rats for every one person in New York, alone."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="261" start="256" end="256">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Everybody would have an affordable phone. Yeah, man, I mean, it'd be messy, but it'd be worth it"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="262" start="257" end="257">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Is he your manager?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="263" start="258" end="258">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Rappers need managers, I'm just tryna get paid right quick."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="264" start="259" end="259">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, man, rap is D-E-D. Dead."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="265" start="260" end="260">
        <attribute name="transcription">"This isn't about rap. If we do this right, your kids can live good. My kids can live good. Darius's kids"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="266" start="261" end="261">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I can't have kids"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="267" start="262" end="262">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'm sure I'll find out why when the time's right"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="268" start="263" end="263">
        <attribute name="transcription">"When is an appropriate time to talk about my balls getting smashed?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="269" start="264" end="264">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Right now, apparently. Look, I'm not dumb. You're older, you have no real fan base. You're not white and/or selling sex."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="270" start="265" end="265">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I sell sex, man. Hey, track twenty-eight, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="271" start="266" end="266">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="272" start="267" end="267">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Woo!" "Yeah. Come on. Ayy."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="273" start="268" end="268">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Muckin'. Muckin', that's massaging. Fuckin'"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="274" start="269" end="269">
        <attribute name="transcription">"See the concept is a massage but it turns" "I get the concept."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="275" start="270" end="270">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Okay, twenty-eight tracks, a lot of skits. I'd cut them."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="276" start="271" end="271">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Nah, but this is different."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="277" start="272" end="272">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, mine are really good."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="278" start="273" end="273">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'd still cut them"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="279" start="274" end="274">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Well you not my manager, Earn"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="280" start="275" end="275" />
      <el index="281" start="276" end="276" />
      <el index="282" start="277" end="277">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I still know people at Diamond House. Promoters, people who manage big-time artists now, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="283" start="278" end="278">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh boy, you think you slick, you coming in here acting like you saving me when really I'm saving you, again."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="284" start="279" end="279">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Nigga I'm tryna help you!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="285" start="280" end="280">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Man, nigga, I ain't seen or heard from you since my mom funeral. And the first thing I hear out your mouth is 'let's get rich.' Walk, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="286" start="281" end="281" />
      <el index="287" start="283" end="283" />
      <el index="288" start="284" end="284">
        <attribute name="transcription">"'Sup, dude?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="289" start="285" end="285">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Earn? Yo, what's up, man?!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="290" start="286" end="286">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You just come from that dumpster?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="291" start="287" end="287">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No. How are you?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="292" start="288" end="288">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh, yo, I'm good, man. I didn't know you were in town!" "Ah, yeah, I've been low-key, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave, Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="293" start="289" end="289">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yo, obviously. Aww, dude, if I knew you was in town, I would've hit you up for this party last night."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="294" start="290" end="290">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yo, we needed a real DJ. This dude"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="295" start="291" end="291">
        <attribute name="transcription">"he can't spin worth a shit, but then goes and he plays Flo Rida"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="296" start="292" end="292">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="297" start="293" end="293">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Back to back."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="298" start="294" end="294">
        <attribute name="transcription">"So I calmly pull him aside and I'm just like, 'really, nigga?'"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="299" start="295" end="295">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You actually said that?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="300" start="296" end="296">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, man, I had to!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="301" start="297" end="297">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Cool. You know that song, 'Paper Boy'?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="302" start="298" end="298">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, Paper Boy by Paper Boy, yeah, I've heard it. Shit's fire, dude, the streets love it."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="303" start="299" end="299">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Y'all should play it."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="304" start="300" end="300">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, for real."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="305" start="301" end="301">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah. You guys should really play it."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="306" start="302" end="302">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, I mean, KP picks all the music."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="307" start="303" end="303">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Well, slide it past him."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="308" start="304" end="304">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I mean, KP will usually spin some records for some scratch up top."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="309" start="305" end="305">
        <attribute name="transcription">"How much?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="310" start="306" end="306">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Half a stack."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="311" start="307" end="307">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Five hundred dollars? Am I buying the station?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="312" start="308" end="308">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Everything is who you know."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="313" start="309" end="309">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Then introduce me."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="314" start="310" end="310">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, I'm gonna introduce every dude in Atlanta with a mixtape to my boss, c'mon."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="315" start="311" end="311">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'm not every dude."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="316" start="312" end="312">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Uh,  you kind of are."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="317" start="313" end="313">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Look, I don't have five hundred dollars. I make five fifteen plus commission. I've gotta pay rent tonight, and my parents won't let me in the house. It's like those drug commercials, except not funny."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="318" start="314" end="314">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Man, you know how niggas out here are. He usually charges a full stack."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="319" start="315" end="315">
        <attribute name="transcription">"And what's in it for you? Why am I so lucky? What's your cut?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="320" start="316" end="316">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh, I'm not about that, I'm too busy, man. I mean, it's just business"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="321" start="317" end="317">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You give me the money, I pass it onto KP."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="322" start="318" end="318">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You know, it's probably for the best. I mean, music business is gross."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="323" start="319" end="319">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Alright man, well you know, it was great seeing you."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="324" start="320" end="320">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I'm taking over for Speedy tonight, alright? Keep it locked."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="325" start="321" end="321">
        <attribute name="transcription">"What's up, my dudes? What's up, bro?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="326" start="322" end="322">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey. Hey."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="327" start="323" end="323">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That guy ever say 'nigga' around you?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="328" start="324" end="324">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, right. I'd break my foot in his ass."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Prince the Janitor</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="329" start="325" end="325">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Right. Hey, um, what's your name?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="330" start="326" end="326">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Prince, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Prince the Janitor</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="331" start="327" end="327">
        <attribute name="transcription">"For real?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="332" start="328" end="328">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Prince the Janitor</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="333" start="329" end="329">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, how late are you here tonight?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="334" start="330" end="330" />
      <el index="335" start="331" end="331" />
      <el index="336" start="332" end="332">
        <attribute name="transcription">"What's up, uncle Riley?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="337" start="333" end="333">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, what's going on, Al?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="338" start="334" end="334">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Man, you know. Hey! Hey, auntie!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy, Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="339" start="335" end="335">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh, hey Lottie!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy, Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="340" start="336" end="336">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, bring Lottie over here, let me say hey to my cousin."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="341" start="337" end="337">
        <attribute name="transcription">"She getting a contact high from here."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Mom</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="342" start="338" end="338">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Contact high. That's that new leather you smelling, you smelling it wrong!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="343" start="339" end="339">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, well, I'm smelling it around your head"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Mom</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="344" start="340" end="340">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Say what?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="345" start="341" end="341">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="346" start="342" end="342">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You got a weird wife, you know that, homie?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="347" start="343" end="343">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, um, hey, look, I know you don't know me, but my name's Darius. Um, I was just wondering, can I measure your tree?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="348" start="344" end="344" />
      <el index="349" start="345" end="345">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No, not right now."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="350" start="346" end="346">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Not right now? That basically means 'no,' man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="351" start="347" end="347">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Look, I got a question."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="352" start="348" end="348">
        <attribute name="transcription">"So, Earn wanna manage me."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="353" start="349" end="349">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Really?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="354" start="350" end="350">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I don't trust him, no offense."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="355" start="351" end="351">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I understand."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="356" start="352" end="352">
        <attribute name="transcription">"That's what's messed up."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="357" start="353" end="353">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I don't really think I know Earn anymore."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="358" start="354" end="354">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Like, what happened at Princeton?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="359" start="355" end="355">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I never asked. He'd tell you before me."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="360" start="356" end="356">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No, Earn's good at keeping his mouth shut."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="361" start="357" end="357" />
      <el index="362" start="358" end="358" />
      <el index="363" start="359" end="359" />
      <el index="364" start="360" end="360" />
      <el index="365" start="361" end="361" />
      <el index="366" start="362" end="362" />
      <el index="367" start="363" end="363">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Earn trying like the rest of us."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="368" start="364" end="364">
        <attribute name="transcription">"But when he wants to do something, he does it."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="369" start="365" end="365">
        <attribute name="transcription">"on his terms."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dad</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="370" start="366" end="366" />
      <el index="371" start="367" end="367" />
      <el index="372" start="368" end="368">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Your mind's racing."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Strange Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="373" start="369" end="369">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Tell me, yo."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Strange Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="374" start="370" end="370" />
      <el index="375" start="371" end="371" />
      <el index="376" start="372" end="372">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I just keep losing."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="377" start="373" end="373">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I mean, are some people just supposed to lose?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="378" start="374" end="374">
        <attribute name="transcription">"For balance in the universe, I mean."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="379" start="375" end="375">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Like are there just some people on Earth who"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="380" start="376" end="376">
        <attribute name="transcription">"are supposed to be here just to make it easier for the winners."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="381" start="377" end="377">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Like, really."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="382" start="378" end="378">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Resistance is the symptom of the way things are,"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Strange Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="383" start="379" end="379">
        <attribute name="transcription">"not the way things necessarily should be."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Strange Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="384" start="380" end="380">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Actual victory belongs to things that simply do not see failure."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Strange Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="385" start="381" end="381">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Let the path push you like a broken branch in a river's current."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Strange Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="386" start="382" end="382">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Nah, nah, I'm not going out like that, but thanks for the advice."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="387" start="383" end="383" />
      <el index="388" start="384" end="384">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Bite the sandwich."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Strange Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="389" start="385" end="385" />
      <el index="390" start="386" end="386">
        <attribute name="transcription">"No, I'm good, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="391" start="387" end="387">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Nigga, if you don't bite this sandwich"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Strange Man</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="392" start="388" end="388" />
      <el index="393" start="389" end="389" />
      <el index="394" start="390" end="390" />
      <el index="395" start="391" end="391" />
      <el index="396" start="392" end="392" />
      <el index="397" start="393" end="393" />
      <el index="398" start="394" end="394" />
      <el index="399" start="395" end="395" />
      <el index="400" start="396" end="396" />
      <el index="401" start="397" end="397" />
      <el index="402" start="398" end="398" />
      <el index="403" start="399" end="399" />
      <el index="404" start="400" end="400">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hello?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="405" start="401" end="401">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey! Hey, man, you hear that?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="406" start="402" end="402">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hear what?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="407" start="403" end="403">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, turn it up, man, turn it up."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="408" start="404" end="404">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, man, tell him I sketched Uncle Riley's"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="409" start="405" end="405">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Paper Boy, boy!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="410" start="406" end="406">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Wow, that was quick."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="411" start="407" end="407">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey man, look, you should come down here. We need to talk right quick."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="412" start="408" end="408">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Like you would with a manager?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="413" start="409" end="409">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Nah, nigga, like I would with a calm your ass down!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="414" start="410" end="410" />
      <el index="415" start="411" end="411" />
      <el index="416" start="412" end="412" />
      <el index="417" start="413" end="413" />
      <el index="418" start="414" end="414">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You want some duds?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="419" start="415" end="415" />
      <el index="420" start="416" end="416">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yuh"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="421" start="417" end="417" />
      <el index="422" start="418" end="418" />
      <el index="423" start="419" end="419" />
      <el index="424" start="420" end="420" />
      <el index="425" start="421" end="421">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Ah"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="426" start="422" end="422">
        <attribute name="transcription">"He found us."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="427" start="423" end="423">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, guys."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="428" start="424" end="424">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey" "Sup?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="429" start="425" end="425">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, how'd you, like, how'd you get in the building?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="430" start="426" end="426">
        <attribute name="transcription">"It's all about who you know. I knew somebody."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="431" start="427" end="427">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, well, I mean, that was unprofessional, and KP's pissed."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="432" start="428" end="428">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Can't be that pissed, they're playing us on the radio right now."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="433" start="429" end="429">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, man, this is Dave. He works at 106.5"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="434" start="430" end="430">
        <attribute name="transcription">"He likes your stuff, so he's got good taste."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="435" start="431" end="431">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Actually, to a fault. Yo, tell them that Flo Rida Story."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="436" start="432" end="432">
        <attribute name="transcription">"It's so funny, yo, tell them!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="437" start="433" end="433">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Oh, uh,"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="438" start="434" end="434">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, so, I was at a station party, and uh,"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="439" start="435" end="435">
        <attribute name="transcription">"The DJ, friend of a friend, was awful, and uh,"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="440" start="436" end="436">
        <attribute name="transcription">"You know, it's a big event for the station, and, and, the party's going and going, and he's ruining it, so, uh, then he goes and he plays Flo Rida"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="441" start="437" end="437">
        <attribute name="transcription">"back to back. I had to go into the booth"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="442" start="438" end="438">
        <attribute name="transcription">"calmly take him aside and look him right in the eyes, and just said really?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="443" start="439" end="439" />
      <el index="444" start="440" end="440">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I don't know, man, I like Flo Rida."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="445" start="441" end="441">
        <attribute name="transcription">"I mean, moms need to enjoy rap too."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Darius</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="446" start="442" end="442">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, I mean, that was a wack-ass story, man. I don't know why he made me tell that."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="447" start="443" end="443">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Yeah, I don't know."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="448" start="444" end="444" />
      <el index="449" start="445" end="445">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Alright, man, well, it was good to see you, Earn."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="450" start="446" end="446">
        <attribute name="transcription">"It was nice to meet you guys."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Dave</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="451" start="447" end="447">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Later, Dave."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="452" start="448" end="448" />
      <el index="453" start="449" end="449">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Say hello to KP for me."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="454" start="450" end="450" />
      <el index="455" start="451" end="451">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey! Hey! Hey, girl."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="456" start="452" end="452">
        <attribute name="transcription">"This is me on the radio."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="457" start="453" end="453">
        <attribute name="transcription">"So what, bitch?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Woman</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="458" start="454" end="454">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Well, same to you, stank-ass broad!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="459" start="455" end="455" />
      <el index="460" start="456" end="456" />
      <el index="461" start="457" end="457">
        <attribute name="transcription">"It's a good song, man"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="462" start="458" end="458">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Kind of hate this song."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="463" start="459" end="459" />
      <el index="464" start="460" end="459" />
      <el index="465" start="460" end="460">
        <attribute name="transcription">"What the? Really, man?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="466" start="461" end="461">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, man! Hey! See, these niggas"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="467" start="462" end="462">
        <attribute name="transcription">"in these streets, man"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="468" start="463" end="463">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Don't mess with the money."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="469" start="464" end="464">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey, man! Hey!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="470" start="465" end="465">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Alfred! Al! Goddamn it." "Hey, man! Hey, man."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Earn, Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="471" start="466" end="466">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hey! Hey, man, Imma need some cash for this mirror, man!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="472" start="467" end="467">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Hello? Hello?" "Hey! Hey!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy, Earn</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="473" start="469" end="469">
        <attribute name="transcription">"tree blocked two lanes of rocky road off US highway seventy-eight"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="474" start="470" end="470">
        <attribute name="transcription">"headed westbound." "Lottie's in her crib, Earn had some business, you out of wine."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Reporter, Mom</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="475" start="471" end="471">
        <attribute name="transcription">"The bottle?"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="476" start="472" end="472">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Thank you!"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="477" start="473" end="473">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Knocked down a power line in Northwest Atlanta"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="478" start="474" end="474">
        <attribute name="transcription">"This was the scene on Mount Paran Road, where a tree fell on a power line. At the height of last night's storms, more than twenty-seven thousand"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="479" start="475" end="475">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Georgia Power customers were in the dark."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="480" start="476" end="476">
        <attribute name="transcription">"A shooting tonight in DeKalb County"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="481" start="477" end="477">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Two suspects, rapper Paper Boy and his manager, Earn Marks, are now in custody."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="482" start="478" end="478">
        <attribute name="transcription">"And one apparently wounded suspect is still at large."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="483" start="479" end="479">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Police are still looking for the wounded suspect as well as the assault weapon. Witnesses say the altercation"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="484" start="480" end="480">
        <attribute name="transcription">"started outside the Wetbar nightclub over a damaged car."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Reporter</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="485" start="481" end="481">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Idiot."</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Van</attribute>
      </el>
      <el index="486" start="482" end="482">
        <attribute name="transcription">"Paper Boy, Paper Boy, all about that paper, boy"</attribute>
        <attribute name="character speaking">Alfred Paper Boy</attribute>
      </el>
    </track>
